WEBVTT

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:02.850
Aoyama-kun, are you alright?

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.420
He’s still breathing.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.180
What a relief...

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:16.240
Aoyama-kun. I’m sorry I dragged you into trouble again.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.340
Uh? Something’s strange...

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:36.070
Huh?

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:37.050
Eh...

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:39.200
Eh... EHH!?

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.990
Ahh nyaaa!! I’VE TURNED INTO A CAT!

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:43.960
NYAAA! WHY!?

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:51.420
Wuaahh!!

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:55.360
This can’t be! I’m sure this has to be a dream, nya!

00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:05.860
That car seemed so big, nya!

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:15.110
Ooh... Do cats always see like this?

00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:18.470
No good. Now’s not the time to be
thinking of such things, nya!

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:32.460
Ichigo-san is late.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:35.800
I’m sure she’s on a date
with Aoyama-kun!

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:42.470
Geez, because of Ichigo, I have to do
these kind of things, I’ll remem...

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:44.020
Oh?

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:49.480
Hmm? I wonder what this clump of black hair is...

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:52.520
Oh, there’s some over here too...

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:54.450
This is cat fur.

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:56.840
What’s wrong?

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.920
That Ichigo! Making me clean up after
she’s shed her tail fur everywhere!

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:06.540
I’m sure she didn’t mean to.

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:08.600
I’m sure it’s the season of fur renewal.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.170
Does that really happen with cat fur?

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:15.720
Yep. I know it for sure, because I once imitated a cat as a special training for “Mock Cat”.

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:19.280
That’s one of the 48 secret arts of our Kung Fu...

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:23.340
I really don’t care if cat fur
renews or not.

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:24.740
But it’s very important!!!

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:34.090
What should I do? Is it possible
for me to stay like this forever?

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:36.740
I don’t want that to happen!

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:41.030
That’s it! Perhaps if I transform into Mew Strawberry I might be able to change back!

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:43.240
Yeah! That’s what I’m gonna do!

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:46.200
Then after that, I’m gonna change into Momomiya Ichigo.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:48.350
It’s so simple!

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:53.880
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE ~nya!

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:03.780
Nya?

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:06.350
It’s useless...

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:09.750
Wuaahh... What do I have to do to change back, nya?

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:12.480
It’s a cat!

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.150
It’s so small!

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:15.250
I want to touch it!

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:20.200
It’s cute!

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:23.360
Give me your whisker!

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:24.890
What a soft tail!

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.100
Ichigo turned into a cat?

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:36.320
Yes, since she’s a Super Lady, possessing
the power of an Iriomote Wildcat.

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:42.380
Although the progress in her ability is surprising indeed,

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:44.270
this side effect is too much...

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:50.150
If we don’t do something about it,

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:52.940
there’s a possibility she could completely turn into a cat.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:57.280
I thought that could happen at some
point, but not this early on.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:00.110
So, what about the other Mews?

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:05.040
Perhaps this animal condition affects
only Ichigo-san. I’m not sure.

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:08.560
I’d say her adaptability is exceptionally high.

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:15.510
Anyway, we should waste no time defeating those Aliens and end this.

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:19.400
What a predicament...
I’ll go look for her.

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:37.490
I’m so tired and hungry...
I can’t take this anymore...

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:41.950
I can’t return to Café Mew Mew
or home looking like this...

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:48.110
Mom... She must be so worried.

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:49.660
What’s up with you?

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:52.030
Who is it?

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:54.370
There’s no need to be afraid.

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:57.310
Are you lost, or hungry, cutie?

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:59.230
Cutie?!

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.400
Don’t you wanna date me?

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:08.160
Wh- What the heck is that?!?!

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:10.300
Come with me, willya?

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:13.660
Y’know, my Mommy is so good at cooking mice!

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:19.760
Geez, he’s so gross. Besides, he’s a “Mommy’s boy”.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.820
Hey, come on, come with me.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:27.580
Er, umm... n-no thank you.

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:30.620
I-I mean, like, I’m in a hurry...

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:31.720
In a hurry?

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:38.980
Come on, meooow... you’re such a hasty girl! So you wanna do it right now?

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:43.780
Okay, then I will, yeah? Yeah?

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:47.280
I’ll kiss you!

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:52.700
Nya!! I still haven’t kissed Aoyama-kun yet!

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:55.200
Let me go...

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:04.710
She’s so cute! ...She is!

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:10.680
She’s cute ...cute!

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:14.470
You’re working overtime tonight?

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:16.640
You just came back from the business trip yesterday.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.610
Your company sure gives you a rough time...

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:25.340
Yes, you’ve got to be grateful for
being busy in these hard times...

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:27.470
But it’s gonna be lonely.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.680
Then, tell me “I love you.”

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:33.430
Do it now, come on...

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:37.650
Me too, darling. ’Till then.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.880
Anyway, what’s Ichigo up to?

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:53.850
The cleaning is going too slowly!

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.770
I’m trying hard to clean this spot!

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.220
Hello?

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:07.800
Oh, good evening.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:12.520
It’s Ichigo-san’s mom...

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:16.090
She says that Ichigo hasn’t contacted her yet,

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:20.250
and her cellphone broke
a few days ago...

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.630
What a long date...

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:24.110
Oh, come on...

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:31.530
Yes, Ichigo-san is here, but she’s
in the bathroom at the moment.

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:34.700
Sure, I’ll tell her.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.330
Good bye.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:40.520
There was no need to lie
to her though.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.980
That’s true. I just said it
without thinking.

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:49.500
What’s her problem?!
She’s taking her time...

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.840
Fine, I’ll start first.

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:53.910
How could she ignore
this beautiful steak...

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.090
I can’t go on, nya...

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:36.280
uuh-nyaaaAAAA!!!

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:43.940
I’m sorry, it seems that my dog frightened you.

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:47.110
Don’t worry, you’re okay now.

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:51.530
Aoyama-kun?!

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:56.740
I see! I’ve been running and ended up at his house!

00:08:56.740 --> 00:08:59.500
Aoyama-kun, it’s me! Me!

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:06.480
Heh, it’s got the same bell as Ichigo.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:09.510
I’m telling you, I’m Ichigo!

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.940
Oh, that’s right.
He can’t understand me.

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:16.390
Poor cat, you’re all dirty.

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:18.820
I’ll take you inside and clean you up.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.270
EHH!!

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:29.280
I bet she’s running around somewhere in a panic again...

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:30.840
What should I do?

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:35.920
Waiii! I’m in Aoyama-kun’s house for the first time!

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:40.830
Maybe it’s not so bad
being a cat after all.

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:44.560
I shouldn’t be saying things
like that, nya!

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:47.560
Over here! Come on, little kitty.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.230
Uh nya?!

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:54.650
Come on, it’s nice and warm.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:58.050
Wuaaahh! A bath– together?!

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:01.890
He’ll be naked – what should I do?!

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:19.340
It was a bit much to think that
Aoyama-kun would get naked.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:29.520
It’s so warm! I feel like I’m in heaven.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:37.070
All done. Is that alright?

00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:42.200
But I did take a bath together with Aoyama kun, didn’t I?

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:43.890
Ya-hahaha!

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:53.440
Aoyama-kun goes to bed so early?

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:56.320
What should I do?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:00.490
I can’t sleep in the same bed with him...

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:04.910
Is everyone angry with me, I wonder?

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:06.080
Ichigo...

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:08.310
Did he just call me?

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:10.300
Ichigo...

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:27.950
I can feel his breath!

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:33.960
Ichigo...

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:40.880
Oh, that’s right – I’m a cat.

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:44.500
A little... just a little kiss...

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:47.210
It would be okay, wouldn’t it?

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.300
What a strange feeling...

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:03.010
W-What are you doing nya?!

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:11.400
What’s this?

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:25.110
No way!

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:26.760
I’ve changed back to normal!

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:31.390
Why? Why did I suddenly become human again?

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:37.630
Ehhh??

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:44.430
I see.

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:46.950
We’re done here too.

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:50.010
We’ve finished... finally.

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:51.310
Thanks for your help.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:54.920
It’s so late already. If I don’t go back now they’ll be worried about me.

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:57.270
I wonder what happened to Ichigo-san?

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:58.880
It’s strange that she didn’t get in touch with us.

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:02.190
Shirogane-oniichan has gone looking for her.

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:04.490
Maybe there was an accident?

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:05.780
Can’t be!

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:08.240
Tomorrow I’ll personally punish them both!

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:09.700
Minto-san...

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:13.140
But I don’t think she could still be with Aoyama-san...

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:15.710
It’s too dangerous!

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:17.800
Calm down! I must calm down!

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:22.570
Anyway, I must get out of here while he’s still asleep.

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:44.630
You can’t go out!

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.220
It’s all over!

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:06.720
I shouldn’t be relieved.

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:14.020
I’m sorry, Aoyama-kun...

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:24.880
Geez, I don’t have the slightest idea of what to do, nya!

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:26.980
I’ve got it!

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:30.370
I’ll change between a human and
a cat each time I kiss someone!

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:32.200
Ehhhh!

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:35.890
So unless I kiss someone, I can’t
go back to being normal, nya?!

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:40.210
Yep! Indeed, you’re rrright... right...

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:42.790
Yeah, Boss!

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:45.040
So we have to drink more tonight, yeah?

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:47.050
Sure!

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:54.310
What a cute cat! Don’t you want me to kiss you?

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:57.770
I don’t think so!

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:03.400
Left this way, even a thousand lives is not enough, nya!

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:05.740
Aoyama-kun, help me please nya!

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:12.360
But, come to think of it...

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:14.640
even if I turn into a human again...

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:16.870
<i>Aoyama-kun...</i>

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.210
<i>Ichigo...</i>

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:26.300
Does this mean I can never
kiss him?!?!

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:31.840
It’s over. The life I used to have...

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:34.800
Goodbye to my love...

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:37.350
It’s alright, cutie.

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:39.340
Eh? Uhhh nya!

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:42.440
Your love isn’t over!

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:45.250
I’m here, am I not?

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:48.760
Waaaah! They have stalkers in the cat world too?!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:51.580
Let’s carry on where we left off.

00:15:54.110 --> 00:15:55.950
NOOO!!!!

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:59.790
Hang on, if I kiss him now,
I’ll turn into a human again...

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:04.730
But, I don’t want what I don’t want!!

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:09.730
Who’s bothering me now,
right in the best part?

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:11.100
Shut up!

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:18.470
You are...?

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:19.620
Run while you can!

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:47.670
No way! I’m going to die!

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:53.280
I really... can’t!

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:59.310
I’m a human. I don’t want
to die as a cat...

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:04.020
<i>Ichigo!</i>

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:09.560
Thank you God, it was good to meet him one last time...

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:10.880
Aoyama-kun...

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:14.880
<i>My name is Aruto.</i>

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.410
<i>Aruto?</i>

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:22.170
Ichigo! Ichigo!

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.270
Ichigo! Don’t die!

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:30.040
S-Shirogane?

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.300
Well, it took you a while to recover...

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:34.050
Uhm? Where’s Aruto?

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:35.260
Aruto?

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:40.140
Yes, a small, gray, male cat...

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:43.810
Really? That’s a relief.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:45.940
Alright then.

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:48.190
Did he find her?

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:49.460
Everyone...

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:52.740
We’ve been suspecting something was going on.

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:54.970
What happened, may I ask?

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:58.150
You can tell us what happened.
Ichigo-san is our friend!

00:17:58.150 --> 00:18:03.040
We’re a team, so don’t keep secrets
from us, Akasaka-san.

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:06.430
You’re right.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.710
Eh?! Really?

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:11.580
Yes, the only way to stop you turning into a cat is...

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:15.650
to eliminate the aliens as quickly as
possible and finish the Mew Project.

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.340
That’s so...!

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:20.620
So, until that’s ended, I’m gonna
transform whenever I kiss?

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:24.230
Anyways where on earth were you?!

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:28.430
If you’d turned into a cat, why didn’t
you come back to the café?

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:30.080
I’ve had a hard time looking for you.

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:34.570
Hey, I haven’t been having an easy time either!

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:37.910
I had so much trouble I couldn’t even think of that!

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:41.010
Don’t cry...

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:46.980
On top of everything, this means that
I can never kiss Aoyama-kun?

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:53.510
I mean... uhm!
The kiss isn’t the problem!

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:56.340
A fat, stalking cat was going to kiss me against my will,

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:58.780
and in Aoyama-kun’s room, umm...

00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:02.090
Kiss, huh?

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:03.410
Hmm, you’re right. It’s a problem.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.350
How can you say it so coldly?

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:07.720
What if I turn into a cat and can’t change back again?

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:09.370
I’m going to sue you!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.030
Come on, say something.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:18.840
Wh- What’s wrong?

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:22.700
You never change.
You’re always so funny...

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:25.060
If you become a cat... just how are you going to sue me?

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:30.410
So that’s what happened...

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:31.940
Ichigo-san turned into a cat...

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:35.360
I’m jealous. She must’ve
been a cute cat!

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:40.180
Y-Yeah...

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:43.320
Don’t laugh!

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:45.770
Don’t worry!

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:49.650
We’ll finish the Mew Project before that happens.

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:56.230
I’ll take you home.
Your mom is worried.

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:57.730
Are you sure?

00:19:57.730 --> 00:19:59.550
Don’t forget that you’re
the leader, okay?

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:05.050
I know... I’m sorry.

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:07.260
Eh? Come again?

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:11.390
I just said I’m sorry. Forgive me.

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:14.910
Wh-Why... All of a sudden...?

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:26.120
Oh, no way!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:29.040
I can understand what cats are saying while I’m human!

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:33.000
Hey, Ichigo, so you’re steadily turning into a real cat!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.670
Don’t say that!

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:37.880
See? You’re growing a lot of hair on your body!

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:41.010
Noooooo! What?! Where?!

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:45.430
Next: “A forbidden love?
I can understand cats” ~nyan!

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:48.520
